  description: "Processes and adjudicates insurance claim using TypeScript implementation. Validates eligibility, checks benefit coverage, applies plan rules (copay/coinsurance/deductible), and determines approval status. Returns approved amount, processing time, and rejection reason if denied. Executes real-time claim adjudication workflow. Algorithmically equivalent to Go and Python implementations."

